  "body": "Some homes have a favourite room. This one has a favourite moment.\r\n\r\nWhen we asked the owners what they loved most about their home, they didn't choose a room. They chose the north facing deck on a sunny afternoon, with nowhere to be. And with expansive rural and ocean views stretching out across the bush to the sea, it's easy to see why.\r\n\r\nElevated on approximately 601sqm, this beautifully renovated property delivers the kind of outlook that turns ordinary weekends into something special. Morning coffee in the sunshine, long lunches overlooking the landscape, and evenings watching the light change across the water. It's coastal living at its best, and the hardest part might just be convincing yourself to leave the deck!\r\n\r\nInside, the modernised main home is designed for easy living and effortless entertaining. The kitchen centres around a generous butler's pantry, keeping everyday clutter tucked away while the open-plan living flows seamlessly onto the expansive, north-facing deck. Double glazing throughout ensures comfort in every season, while the fresh, contemporary finish means you can move in, unpack and start enjoying everything this home has to offer.\r\n\r\nBut the real game-changer? A fully consented, beautifully renovated sleep out with its own entrance and bathroom.Whether you need space for teenagers craving independence, extended family, visiting guests or a dedicated work-from-home setup, this versatile addition gives everyone room to spread out without losing that sense of togetherness. Double glazed throughout, it offers flexibility that's increasingly hard to find.\r\n\r\nWith extensive off street parking, a workshop and additional space for hobbies, storage or projects, there's practicality here to match the lifestyle.\r\n\r\nAnd the location? Enjoy Orewa's vibrant town centre, cafes, restaurants and golden beach, with Silverdale's shopping and amenities also within easy reach. Enjoy coastal walks and cycling, a swim at Hatfields Beach or a picnic at nearby regional parks.\r\n\r\nHomes offering this combination of spectacular views, fresh renovations, versatile living and genuine flexibility don't come along every day. Whether you're upsizing, accommodating extended family or simply ready for a home that offers more, this is an opportunity worth moving quickly for.\r\n\r\nAlthough, if you ask the owners, the best place to be is still right there on the deck, soaking up the sunshine with nowhere else to go.\r\n\r\nCome for the views. Stay for the lifestyle. Don't miss your chance to make it yours.\r\n\r\nPROPERTY HIGHLIGHTS\r\nTHE MAIN HOME\r\n\r\n* 3 bedrooms\r\n* 1 bathroom\r\n* Beautifully renovated throughout\r\n* Double glazing throughout\r\n* Modern kitchen with generous butler's pantry/scullery/laundry\r\n* Open-plan living and dining flowing outdoors\r\n* Expansive, north-facing deck and entertaining area\r\n* Sweeping rural, bush and ocean views\r\n* Elevated position on approximately 601sqm\r\n* Plenty of off street parking\r\n* Workshop and additional storage space\r\n\r\nTHE SEPARATE SLEEP OUT\r\n\r\n* 1 bedroom\r\n* Separate study\r\n* Own bathroom\r\n* Separate lounge\r\n* Beautifully renovated throughout\r\n* Double glazing throughout\r\n* Independent entrance for added privacy\r\n* Fully consented with Code Compliance Certificate (CCC)\r\n* Ideal for extended family, teenagers, guests or working from home\r\n\r\nHomes in this desired location that offer so much don't last long! \r\n\r\nAuction: 4:00pm, Thursday 19 November 2026 In Rooms, Ray White Orewa (unless sold prior). You can watch the auction live here: https://rwcarpenterrealty.co.nz/watch-our-auctions-live",
